<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto">
      <div class="card shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-5">
          <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>

          <p class="lead mb-4">Last Updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %></p>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">1. Ticket Refund Policy</h2>
            <p>This policy outlines the terms and conditions for refunds related to ticket purchases on our platform.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">2. General Refund Terms</h2>
            <p>All ticket sales are considered final once completed. However, refunds may be issued under the following circumstances:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Event cancellation by the organizer or artist</li>
              <li>Significant rescheduling of the event (as determined by the organizer)</li>
              <li>Significant venue change that makes attendance impractical</li>
              <li>Technical error in the payment processing system that resulted in duplicate charges</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">3. Event Cancellation</h2>
            <p>If an event is cancelled by the organizer or artist:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Full refunds will be processed automatically within 7-10 business days</li>
              <li>You will be notified via email about the cancellation and refund process</li>
              <li>The refund will be issued to the original payment method used for the purchase</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">4. Event Rescheduling</h2>
            <p>If an event is rescheduled:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Your tickets will remain valid for the new date</li>
              <li>If you cannot attend on the new date, you may request a refund within 14 days of the rescheduling announcement</li>
              <li>Refund requests after the 14-day period may not be honored</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">5. Venue Changes</h2>
            <p>If the venue for an event changes significantly:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Your tickets will remain valid for the new venue</li>
              <li>If the new venue is more than 50km from the original venue, you may request a refund</li>
              <li>Refund requests must be submitted within 14 days of the venue change announcement</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">6. Technical Errors</h2>
            <p>If you experience a technical error resulting in duplicate charges or incorrect ticket purchases:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Contact our support team immediately at support@rapira.com</li>
              <li>Provide proof of the duplicate or erroneous charges</li>
              <li>Refunds for technical errors will be processed within 5-7 business days after verification</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">7. Non-Refundable Items</h2>
            <p>The following are not eligible for refunds:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Service fees and processing charges</li>
              <li>Tickets for events that you simply choose not to attend</li>
              <li>Tickets purchased from unauthorized resellers or third parties</li>
              <li>Lost, stolen, or damaged tickets</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">8. Refund Processing Time</h2>
            <p>Refunds are typically processed within 7-10 business days. However, depending on your payment method and financial institution, it may take additional time for the refund to appear in your account.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">9. How to Request a Refund</h2>
            <p>To request a refund:</p>
            <ol>
              <li>Log in to your account</li>
              <li>Navigate to "My Tickets" in your profile</li>
              <li>Select the ticket you wish to refund</li>
              <li>Click on the "Request Refund" button</li>
              <li>Fill out the refund request form with your reason and bank details</li>
              <li>Submit the form and wait for admin approval</li>
            </ol>
            <p>Please note:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Refund requests can only be made for paid tickets</li>
              <li>Refunds cannot be requested after the concert date has passed</li>
              <li>You must provide valid bank account details for the refund to be processed</li>
              <li>Refund requests are subject to review and may be approved or rejected based on our policy</li>
              <li>Once approved, refunds typically take 7-10 business days to appear in your account</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">10. Special Circumstances</h2>
            <p>In cases of extraordinary circumstances (such as natural disasters, public health emergencies, etc.), special refund policies may be implemented. These will be communicated directly to affected ticket holders.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">11. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about our refund policy, please contact us at:</p>
            <p>Email: support@rapira.com<br>
            Phone: +91 123 456 7890<br>
            Hours: Monday-Friday, 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM IST</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
